  "description": "<p>Starting 14 February 2026, this is an editor tool only and not a dependency mod.\nI am leaving the versions available so that the mod is still available for the mods that need it but there will be no further versions published.</p>\n<p>The way to properly use this package is to download the .unitypackage file from the github and import it into your unity 2022 project.</p>\n<p>You may either have the shaders build directly into your bundles or you may designate a dependency bundle for the shaders you use to build into, if you know how to designate bundle dependencies in your bundles.json</p>\n<p>All I ask is that you credit me if you use these shaders, thank you.</p>\n<p>If you need any help using this package please contact me in the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/Nz6VX78xRa\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT Discord</a>.</p>\n",
